## Token hygiene & session economy

- **CLAUDE.md ≤ 200 lines.** Keep root small; details go in `docs/`.
- **`SKILL.md` must have a `## Token budget` section.** Skills that
  read big files use Grep + offset Reads, not full slurps.
- **`/clear` between skills** to dump stale Reads from context.
- **Sub-agents preserve main-session context** — delegate broad
  exploration to `Explore` instead of inlining 5+ Greps.
- **Never delete the `else` branch of global `~/.claude/settings.json`
  hooks** — they affect ALL projects.

